  "design_notes": [
    "V1 motion exists numerically but was too faint in full-scene user review. Broad basin transport and moving terrain-only shadow are the principal actions.",
    "Forward source-cloud renewal is local to safe sky; the ring and mountain pixels cannot enter sampled source taps. Inspect possible renewal softness in playback.",
    "Haze has three source-coordinate speeds, independently renewed local plumes and terrain/glass occlusion. Not a physical atmosphere simulation.",
    "All exterior masks protect interior geometry. Survey indicators map to existing panels. No camera movement, global exposure sweep or whole-scene dissolve.",
    "Warm daytime window changes are supporting details, not the principal motion. No music, generated SFX or opening title is baked into this silent review.",
    "V3 user requests village activity and occasional desk-lamp flicker. Preserve all V2 layers outside the new source-mapped village and lamp footprints."
  ],
